How to run QUERYMATE?? (DOCKER IMAGE)
just run below two commands

1. docker pull tecblend/querymate
2. docker run -p 3000:3000 tecblend/querymate

It will run Querymate on the port 3000 in your pc. Go to the http://localhost:3000/

----------------------------------------OR--------------------------------------

Clone the project in your pc.
There are three directories in GitLab, frontend,backend and team-website.
go to the frontend directory by command cd and run below command.

docker run -p 3000:3000 querymate

it will run into our local machine on the port 3000.

How to Use QUERYMATE??

For users : create a account if you don't have and just login with credentials and it will be redirect to "user dashboard". Now ask queries and get the answers.

For admins : There are saperate credentials for admins
email: team.techblend@gmail.com
Password: Techblend@123

sign in with this credantials and you will be redirect on "admin-dashboard".

In admin-dashboard, you can see the active workflows of user queries.
